<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><h1 data-lake-id="jEaW4" id="jEaW4"><span data-lake-id="u5425c332" id="u5425c332">1.数组指针</span></h1><p data-lake-id="0588ff4090270cb43d40823ce72719c7" id="0588ff4090270cb43d40823ce72719c7"><span data-lake-id="u37680933" id="u37680933" class="lake-fontsize-12">学习数组指针之前，先来了解下数组下标的具体含义，其实际上是编译系统的一种简写，其等价形式是：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20100%3B%20%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E%20%20*(a%2Bi)%20%3D%20100%3B%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Uwanm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="13c30c050d72c4c1ef281de643aae6c8" id="13c30c050d72c4c1ef281de643aae6c8"><span data-lake-id="ue5b4bd54" id="ue5b4bd54" class="lake-fontsize-12">根据加法交换律，以下的所有的语句均是等价的：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20a%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cn*(a%2Bi)%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cn*(i%2Ba)%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cn%20%20i%5Ba%5D%20%3D%20100%3B%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22irB1N%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="4240d3852d7d7f036b86513e44674197" id="4240d3852d7d7f036b86513e44674197"><span data-lake-id="udf547237" id="udf547237" class="lake-fontsize-12">由上可知，数组运算，等价于指针运算。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20arr%5B%5D%20%3D%20%7B%2099%2C%2015%2C%20100%2C%20888%2C%20252%20%7D%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20len%20%3D%20sizeof(arr)%20%2F%20sizeof(int)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E6%B1%82%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for(i%3D0%3B%20i%3Clen%3B%20i%2B%2B)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%20%20%5C%22%2C%20*(arr%2Bi)%20)%3B%20%20%2F%2F*(arr%2Bi)%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8Earr%5Bi%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IruZl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="89901c886aee77c21897b8479eff7def" id="89901c886aee77c21897b8479eff7def"><span data-lake-id="udb31c837" id="udb31c837" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言中指针和数组的关系是非常紧密的，理解指针和数组之间的关系对于熟练掌握C语言非常关键,需要知道的是，用指针处理数组的主要原因是效率，但是这里 的效率提升已经不再像当初那么重要了，这主要归功于编译器的改 进。</span></p><p data-lake-id="c2be66ee02828d302f50a5def41a7e8c" id="c2be66ee02828d302f50a5def41a7e8c"><span data-lake-id="u7cf2f21c" id="u7cf2f21c" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="e83679cffda33d718fe8b1effd5263b6" id="e83679cffda33d718fe8b1effd5263b6"><span data-lake-id="u88ea7ebf" id="u88ea7ebf" class="lake-fontsize-12">有上述可知，指针可以指向数组元素。例如，假设已经声明a 和p 如下：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%5B10%5D%2C%20*p%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UOckk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="076deaafb6350f4489ac1b3000075827" id="076deaafb6350f4489ac1b3000075827"><span data-lake-id="uda2335ff" id="uda2335ff" class="lake-fontsize-12">通过下列写法可以使p 指向a[0] ：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p%20%3D%20%26a%5B0%5D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y7vcF%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="beb037003d128e90c16ccdd4421570c9" id="beb037003d128e90c16ccdd4421570c9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560127552-776ac90e-0b60-4b4a-9694-97da2b15fa2f.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A488%2C%22height%22%3A173%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A654%2C%22originHeight%22%3A232%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0f0f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wnh0F%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="28ab8af10de921cbe8d5e598e11f82e8" id="28ab8af10de921cbe8d5e598e11f82e8"><span data-lake-id="u65ac01b1" id="u65ac01b1" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="476fdd0cab70f4c7ce4a73a58af03e30" id="476fdd0cab70f4c7ce4a73a58af03e30"><span data-lake-id="u4355e2c6" id="u4355e2c6" class="lake-fontsize-12">现在可以通过p 访问a[0] 。例如，可以通过下列写法把值5存入 a[0] 中：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22*p%20%3D%205%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kMplv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ed1781dbd768083556ce6509499dd299" id="ed1781dbd768083556ce6509499dd299" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560127863-737acadc-45c8-49b6-95b6-9b71ca2df1d7.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A529%2C%22height%22%3A200%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A659%2C%22originHeight%22%3A249%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1f1f1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qefpf%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="84a2cd7a43bca845ef6c110b7c536cb9" id="84a2cd7a43bca845ef6c110b7c536cb9"><span data-lake-id="u199337b9" id="u199337b9" class="lake-fontsize-12">把指针p 指向数组a 的元素不是特别令人激动。还记得上节课的指针运算吗？C语言支持3种（而且只有3种）格式的指针算术运算：</span></p><ul list="uca07ffb1"><li fid="u248b2131" data-lake-id="u434e48cd" id="u434e48cd"><span data-lake-id="u7e73e33b" id="u7e73e33b" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针加上整数</span></li><li fid="u248b2131" data-lake-id="u18a02811" id="u18a02811"><span data-lake-id="uc930b55c" id="uc930b55c" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针减去整数</span></li><li fid="u248b2131" data-lake-id="u2f6b366e" id="u2f6b366e"><span data-lake-id="u0f3f7e94" id="u0f3f7e94" class="lake-fontsize-12">两个指针相减（相加不行）</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="f06f036fb32b5017aa12e61a8396e53a" id="f06f036fb32b5017aa12e61a8396e53a"><span data-lake-id="u2b855c79" id="u2b855c79" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="93af386477ddaaa06fbfc738048f4b4b" id="93af386477ddaaa06fbfc738048f4b4b"><span data-lake-id="uc90cd52b" id="uc90cd52b" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="665735e9d78111d1e612f1f0e9d9c15f" id="665735e9d78111d1e612f1f0e9d9c15f"><span data-lake-id="u3eb2e9ef" id="u3eb2e9ef" class="lake-fontsize-12">下面的所有例子都假设有如下声明</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%5B10%5D%2C%20*p%2C%20*q%2C%20i%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D6pjZ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="nBGbb" id="nBGbb"><span data-lake-id="ua2537b3e" id="ua2537b3e">1.1 指针加上整数</span></h2><p data-lake-id="1b936927595495754d1073d6ed0aba3b" id="1b936927595495754d1073d6ed0aba3b"><span data-lake-id="ua82c3b98" id="ua82c3b98" class="lake-fontsize-12">回顾上节课说的，指针p 加上整数j ，实际就是指针p指向的地址移动了j个单位。如果p 指向数组元素 a[i] ，那么p+j 指向a[i + j] （当然，前提是a[i + j] 必须 存在）。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p%20%3D%20%26a%5B2%5D%3B%20%20%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QOAPE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="608d72c2d343e9250779a0ea62592ac2" id="608d72c2d343e9250779a0ea62592ac2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560128155-f405e2a9-06fa-451b-8742-c6f371985227.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A505%2C%22originHeight%22%3A178%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0f0f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PGr4K%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="eb4f84945d75d037741358873e4116f0" id="eb4f84945d75d037741358873e4116f0"><span data-lake-id="u13e57809" id="u13e57809" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q%20%3D%20p%20%2B%203%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7a%5B2%2B3%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FQNmP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="18ef07afec38cbfc30fd63b55d555699" id="18ef07afec38cbfc30fd63b55d555699" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560128324-e3fbf6fe-baa5-4ada-925f-bf1e1b192af5.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A492%2C%22originHeight%22%3A178%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eeeeee%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YmSj3%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="24c3333f10483400d63e7b2e4c7e95a8" id="24c3333f10483400d63e7b2e4c7e95a8"><span data-lake-id="u662e326f" id="u662e326f" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p%20%2B%3D%206%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sIg3g%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="cb5bfbd5b18e9e1765b0ceaafbadea6f" id="cb5bfbd5b18e9e1765b0ceaafbadea6f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560128519-83dbfeed-2612-4db8-9955-a24ce39eec9b.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A483%2C%22originHeight%22%3A176%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eeeeee%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iFqER%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="afbe0fdaf573112782fb071451722256" id="afbe0fdaf573112782fb071451722256"><span data-lake-id="ud64bf214" id="ud64bf214" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针减去一个整数和指针相减同理，这里不做说明</span></p><p data-lake-id="u363ff8e8" id="u363ff8e8"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A0%2C%22id%22%3A%22i3MUF%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="uaba0ed79" id="uaba0ed79" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E4%B8%BA%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E9%87%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%AD%98%E6%94%BE%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E4%B8%BA%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%98%AF%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E4%B8%BA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E5%B1%85%E5%A4%9A%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%8A%8A%E6%AD%A4%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20int%20*buf%5B5%5D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a1%20%3D%2020%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a2%20%3D%2030%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20buf%5B0%5D%20%3D%20%26a%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20buf%5B1%5D%20%3D%20%26a1%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20buf%5B2%5D%20%3D%20%26a2%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C*(buf%5B1%5D))%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%5Cnchar%20*p%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B%5C%22jack%5C%22%2C%5C%22rose%5C%22%2C%5C%22ken%5C%22%2C%5C%22tony%5C%22%2C%5C%22tom%5C%22%7D%3B%20%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cp%5B2%5D)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25c%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cp%5B3%5D%5B3%5D)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hW9NU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="CMgXX" id="CMgXX"><span data-lake-id="u62e32297" id="u62e32297">2.数组名含义</span></h1><p data-lake-id="683813a7a59610bd30627f8500be885a" id="683813a7a59610bd30627f8500be885a"><span data-lake-id="u25572c51" id="u25572c51" class="lake-fontsize-12">数组名在不同情形会表现为不同的含义：</span></p><ul list="u4c461a25"><li fid="u943f74e7" data-lake-id="u3ef40fdd" id="u3ef40fdd"><span data-lake-id="u000f0b94" id="u000f0b94" class="lake-fontsize-12">第一含义是整个数组</span></li><li fid="u943f74e7" data-lake-id="u2623a89d" id="u2623a89d"><span data-lake-id="u7a915207" id="u7a915207" class="lake-fontsize-12">第二含义是首元素地址</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="d831bdc0d8852f9691951343a4ee32f1" id="d831bdc0d8852f9691951343a4ee32f1"><span data-lake-id="u8713777e" id="u8713777e" class="lake-fontsize-12">触发第一含义的情形：</span></p><ul list="uadeeab9e"><li fid="uea763d86" data-lake-id="u14542b1f" id="u14542b1f"><span data-lake-id="ub8b13d44" id="ub8b13d44" class="lake-fontsize-12">在数组定义中   //这里的数组名表示整个数组，定义的是整个数组</span></li><li fid="uea763d86" data-lake-id="uf0957233" id="uf0957233"><span data-lake-id="u821f5861" id="u821f5861" class="lake-fontsize-12">在 sizeof 运算表达式中  //sizeof(数组名)，这里的数组名表示整个数组，计算的是整个数组的大小</span></li><li fid="uea763d86" data-lake-id="u4639d5ee" id="u4639d5ee"><span data-lake-id="u92c98bda" id="u92c98bda" class="lake-fontsize-12">在取址符&amp;中  //&amp;数组名，这里的数组名表示整个数组，取出的是整个数组的地址</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="2373a9e3a6e9d5ca6eb1df5d46a413fc" id="2373a9e3a6e9d5ca6eb1df5d46a413fc"><span data-lake-id="u2d5faabe" id="u2d5faabe" class="lake-fontsize-12">除了第一含义以外，所有情况都是第二含义。</span></p><p data-lake-id="40d988310a5d1f9334a91a5bccfab0a0" id="40d988310a5d1f9334a91a5bccfab0a0"><span data-lake-id="u56aa74ef" id="u56aa74ef" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="528c6c58497be5fc80969805f644bab6" id="528c6c58497be5fc80969805f644bab6"><span data-lake-id="uf69700ea" id="uf69700ea" class="lake-fontsize-12">细心的同学可能已经发现，数组名的第二个含义似乎跟指针有关，</span></p><p data-lake-id="942a8899a45e781823eecb5f43f8868f" id="942a8899a45e781823eecb5f43f8868f"><span data-lake-id="u98586160" id="u98586160" class="lake-fontsize-12">没错，我们还</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue508917d" id="ue508917d" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以用数组的名字作为指向数组第一个元素的指针 </span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf82afb16" id="uf82afb16" class="lake-fontsize-12">。这种关系简化了指针的算术运算， 而且使数组和指针更加通用。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E7%94%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8Ea%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%5B10%5D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%94%A8a%20%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9a%5B0%5D%20%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%20%20%20%20*a%20%3D%207%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8Ea%5B0%5D%3D7%EF%BC%9B%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88a%20%2B%201%20%E6%9D%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9a%5B1%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20*(a%20%2B%201)%20%3D%2012%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8Ea%5B1%5D%3D12%3B%20a%5B0%2B1%5D%3D12%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tiu3P%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="2dc65a965a562a9572e9e2e25420bb88" id="2dc65a965a562a9572e9e2e25420bb88"><span data-lake-id="uf07ecc88" id="uf07ecc88" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：通常情况下，a + i 等同于&amp;a[i] （两者都表示指向数组a 中元素 i 的指针），并且*(a+i) 等价于a[i] （两者都表示元素i 本 身）。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u72eaec68" id="u72eaec68"><span data-lake-id="u25272c23" id="u25272c23" class="lake-fontsize-12">换句话说，可以把数组的取下标操作看成是指针算术运算的一 种形式</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6d61be57" id="u6d61be57"><span data-lake-id="u8e4a64de" id="u8e4a64de" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="8484c7fbefaa530f43c61d84c6de5bc3" id="8484c7fbefaa530f43c61d84c6de5bc3"><span data-lake-id="uad1c29e5" id="uad1c29e5" class="lake-fontsize-12">下面的例子说明了数组名代表首元素地址和整个数组的区别：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F*%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F1.%E5%9C%A8%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%AD%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%5B10%5D%3B%20%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F2.%E5%9C%A8%20sizeof%20%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%AD%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25ld%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Csizeof(a))%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F3.%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%96%E5%9D%80%E7%AC%A6%26%E4%B8%AD%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%26a)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20*%2F%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20arr%5B%5D%3D%7B10%2C11%2C12%2C13%2C14%7D%3B%20%2F%2F5*4%3D20%5Cn%5C